    14	## E8 — joins between the TLA+ and ProVerif models
    15	
    16	ProVerif cannot consume a TLA+ result; every join is a ledger entry carried in prose and "never" marked
    17	symbolically discharged (`suite/ENUMERATION.md:137-147`; `suite/LEDGER.md:919-937`). The capstone does not
    18	discharge any of them (`suite/capstone/PREDICTIONS.md:1974-1981`).
